  "job_C16.2_20251003_115216": {
    "chunk_text": "m\u00e6den carful, \u00feancful, nytwyr\u00fee, cl\u00e6ne; tacn Somnium cito fiet; cela sw\u00e6fnen ra\u00fee hit gewyr\u00f0; bedigla. Non est bona luna sanguinem minuere ys na god mona blod l\u00e6tan. Luna X; omnibus rebus agendis bona; in domum nouam intrare, pueros in scolam mittere mona se Puer natus neglegens, laboriosus in prima etate.cild acenned gimeleas, geswincful on forman ylde. Puella benigna, l\u00ebtifica; per etatem melius ac melius agit m\u00e6den milde, wultewestre; \u00feurh ylde bed & Qui recumbit, cito moritur aut cito surgit se\u00fee geli\u00f0, ra\u00f0e he styrf\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e genunge he arise\u00f0. Somnia uana sunt.swefnu ydele sint. Ab hora VI usque sero bona luna sanguinem minuere fram tide \u00fe\u00e6re syxtan \u00e6fen god mona blod Luna XI; beneficium petere, arbores abscidere, apes inuadere utilis est mona se \u00e6ndlefta, wyld\u00e6da Puer natus feruidus, callidus, animosus; in postera \u00ebtate melius agit cild acenned weallend, abere\u00f0, Puella signum in fronte & in mamilla habens; sapiens erit, casta; in \u00ebtate non bona morte morietur Eger diu languescit uel celeriter surgit seoc lang adla\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e r\u00e6dlice arist. Somnium inter IIII dies fiet; esto swefne betwuh feower dagas gewyr\u00f0; beo \u00feu. Similiter bona luna non est sanguinem minuere ealswa god mona nys blod l\u00e6tan. Luna XII; omnibus operibus utilis est; seminare, uxorem ducere, iter pergere.",
